    {
      "id": "intro_1",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Why did Hugh's diet not work?",
      "translation": "为什么休的节食没有起作用？",
      "startTime": 10.28,
      "endTime": 15.32,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Not",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "不，不是"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_2",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "My friend, Hugh, has always been fat,",
      "translation": "我的朋友休一直很胖，",
      "startTime": 15.33,
      "endTime": 19.76,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "My",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "我的"
          },
          {
            "word": "Fat",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "胖的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_3",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "but things got so bad recently that he decided to go on a diet.",
      "translation": "但最近情况变得很糟糕，以至于他决定节食。",
      "startTime": 19.77,
      "endTime": 26.31,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "That",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "那个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_4",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "He began his diet a week ago.",
      "translation": "一个星期前他开始节食。",
      "startTime": 26.32,
      "endTime": 29.6,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "First of all, he wrote out a long list of all the foods which were forbidden.",
      "translation": "首先，他开列了一张长长的单子，上面列了所有禁吃的食物。",
      "startTime": 29.61,
      "endTime": 36.87,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "The list included most of the things Hugh loves:",
      "translation": "这张单子上的大多数是休喜欢吃的食物：",
      "startTime": 36.88,
      "endTime": 41.29,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "butter, potatoes, rice, beer, milk, chocolate, and sweets.",
      "translation": "黄油、土豆、米饭、啤酒、牛奶、巧克力和糖果。",
      "startTime": 41.3,
      "endTime": 48.63,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "Yesterday I paid him a visit.",
      "translation": "昨天我去看望了他。",
      "startTime": 48.64,
      "endTime": 51.96,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "I rang the bell and was not surprised to see that Hugh was still as fat as ever.",
      "translation": "我按响了门铃，当看到休仍和以前一样胖时我并不感到惊讶。",
      "startTime": 51.97,
      "endTime": 59.27,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Not",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "不，不是"
          },
          {
