    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "he smiled guiltily and then put the parcel on the desk.",
      "translation": "他内疚地笑了笑，然后把那个大包放到了桌子上。",
      "startTime": 72.7,
      "endTime": 77.77,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "He explained that his diet was so strict that he had to reward himself occasionally.",
      "translation": "他解释说，他的饮食控制得太严格了，以至于不得不偶尔奖励自己一下。",
      "startTime": 77.78,
